Hi,
I would like to start the vote on KIP-1313. This adds a unique client insta=
nce ID to the request header of all Kafka protocol requests to give a uniqu=
e identifier which can be used to correlate the requests from each client f=
or the purposes of problem determination.

KIP: https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1313%3A+Client+i=
nstance+ID+in+all+request+headers

Discussion thread: https://lists.apache.org/thread/loxjb8owwjplnjz3sk6dqkm5=
gkkn3xt4

Thanks,
Andrew

