Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

Hello All,

I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1321: Headers Aware
StreamPartitioner. This need was identified while implementing headers
support for state stores (KIP-1271).

The proposal involves adding a default method to the public interface and
propagating headers to the underlying serde. This change will enable users
to build custom partitioners based on header information.

KIP-1321:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/phttps://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/=
x/pYwmGQYwmGQ
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/pYwmGQ>

Best regards,
Uladzislau Blok


