Subject: Re: [DISCUSS] KIP-1291: Extended I/O Metrics Collection
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 15:01:57 +0800
References: <CAD38bmRFmzEy8sYqfGSaksV31VvOoGRtFyHObcRer186nBHGxQ@mail.gmail.com>
 <pony-9bba1efe-0610-40ee-b0c4-66c5328d5d0e-dev@kafka.apache.org>
