oads, the tagged field in the header will essentially become a required field=
. This means the broker needs to handle the edge case where both the header a=
nd the request body have no ClientInstanceId, right? If so, would you mind cl=
arifying the expected broker behavior in the KIP?

Best,
Chia-Ping

