Hi Jun,
Thanks for your response.

JR20: I have improved (I hope) the wording. The client sends request.clientIn=
stanceId =3D 0 and header.clientInstanceId =3D UUID-H, and the broker respond=
s response.clientInstanceId=3DUUID-H. In this way, the broker will have taken=
 the UUID-H from the header, and told the client to use it for client telemet=
ry also.

JR21: Done. Look for "henceforth".

JR22: Summary table added.

Thanks,
Andrew

