Hi reviewers,

Thank you to everyone who voted.

This candidate received 3 binding votes (Mickael, Josep, and Lucas) and 2
non-binding votes (Jakub and Maros). However, we would like to include two
additional Jira issues (KAFKA-19851 and KAFKA-20380), so I have created a
new release candidate.

Discussion thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/2xn838tms1vzwg7wltjg9fg8fk9o0lbt
New vote thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/78dx1rv74p0mfzpprvgzjzb29mr77srq

Thank you,
PoAn

