Hi Mickael,
while this was going on I was doing some validation and I did:

- checked the signatures and checksums
- Tested Docker Images:
-- can start
-- can create topics
- ran quickstart
- ran sample apps with consumer groups
- checked Java client interaction from artifacts (admin, producer, consumer
and streams)
- check Tiered Storage offloads to remote storage (with Aiven's plugin)
- check Kafka Connect

+1 (binding).

Regarding whether to make another RC or not. I don't see these issues as
blockers and if really needed they will definitely land in 4.3.1.

Best,

