Looking for some Kafka Streams=C2=A0expertise on an issue we&#39;re investi=
gating.<br>
<br>
Problem: A KafkaStreams-based consumer stops polling after ~15 minutes of t=
opic inactivity. The adapter stays alive, but no messages are picked up unt=
il it&#39;s manually restarted. Reproduces on both IBM MQ-backed Kafka and =
Confluent Cloud.<br>
<br>
Suspected cause: Back-to-back expiry of <span style=3D"color:rgb(18,100,163=
)"><a href=3D"https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://connections.max.idle.ms__;=
!!Ayb5sqE7!qDd1fD9MUnSkUKBp87L-d7AAytECy6bSvnZr5Amy6Hm1ahQco5UP2P_hyAqUS2pA=
