Hi all,

While there are still a few pending RCs, I'd like to start the discussion
for the 4.4.0 Release Manager. Omnia has raised her hand offline, and we
(myself and our team) are fully committed to supporting her throughout her
first release process.

Of course, please feel free to shout out if anyone else is also interested
in volunteering or co-managing this release.

Best, Chia-Ping

