Thanks Chia for starting the thread and for the support with my first =
release process,=20

I had a quick look into open and resolved issues on jira and I can see =
we have=20
66 resolved tickets.=20
43 open tickets (with status not resolved, or closed)=20

The KIPs I can see marked for 4.4.0, have sub-tasks marked for 4.4.0 or =
remaining followups are=20
KIP-1191: Dead-letter queues for share groups =
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1191%3A+Dead-letter=
+queues+for+share+groups> majority of it has been resolved and marked =
for 4.4.0 except single remaining jira which in progress=20
KIP-892: Transactional Semantics for StateStores =
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-892%3A+Transactiona=
l+Semantics+for+StateStores> is also marked for 4.4.0 but it has too =
many in-progress tasks at the moment=20
KIP-1263: Group Coordinator Assignment Batching and Offload =
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1263%3A+Group+Coord=
inator+Assignment+Batching+and+Offload> it has a couple of open jiras =
one of them marked for 4.4.0
Single resolved jira for KIP-1226: Introducing Share Partition Lag =
Persistence and Retrieval =
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1226%3A+Introducing=
+Share+Partition+Lag+Persistence+and+Retrieval>
Open Jira for KIP-1298: Per-Resource-Type Authorization for =
LIST_CONFIG_RESOURCES =
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1298%3A+Per-Resourc=
e-Type+Authorization+for+LIST_CONFIG_RESOURCES?src=3Djira> but this =
still under discussion
Open Jira for KIP-1170: Unify cluster metadata bootstrapping =
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1170%3A+Unify+clust=
er+metadata+bootstrapping?src=3Djira>
Open Jira for KIP-1260: Enable ProducerPerformance to abort transactions =
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1260%3A+Enable+Prod=
ucerPerformance+to+abort+transactions> but this still under discussion
KIP-939: Support Participation in 2PC =
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-939%3A+Support+Part=
icipation+in+2PC> marked for 4.4.0 but I can it still has couple of =
jiras still not resolved
Some open jiras as followup for KIP-853=20

Best=20
Omnia=20

> On 13 May 2026, at 11:21, Chia-Ping Tsai <chia7712@gmail.com> wrote:
>=20
> Hi all,
>=20
> While there are still a few pending RCs, I'd like to start the =
discussion
> for the 4.4.0 Release Manager. Omnia has raised her hand offline, and =
we
> (myself and our team) are fully committed to supporting her throughout =
her
> first release process.
>=20
> Of course, please feel free to shout out if anyone else is also =
interested
> in volunteering or co-managing this release.
>=20
> Best, Chia-Ping


