Hi all,

Thanks Omnia for volunteering for 4.4! +1 from me.

We're working on KIP-1332: Dynamic memory allocation for the Kafka
producer, under discussion at the moment but aiming at a phased delivery
starting in 4.4 (I updated the jiras)

Best!
Lianet

