> majority of it has been resolved and marked for 4.4.0 except single
> remaining jira which in progress
> KIP-892: Transactional Semantics for StateStores <
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-892%3A+Transactiona=
l+Semantics+for+StateStores>
> is also marked for 4.4.0 but it has too many in-progress tasks at the
> moment
