       Resolution: Fixed

> Flaky test ShareConsumerRackAwareTest.testShareConsumerWithRackAwareAssig=
nor
> -------------------------------------------------------------------------=
---
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-20563
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20563
>             Project: Kafka
