+---
+date: TBD
+title: Apache Kafka 4.3.0 Release Announcement
+linkTitle: AK 4.3.0
+author: Mickael Maison
+aliases:
+  - /blog/T/B/D/apache-kafka-4.3.0-release-announcement/
+---
+
