Hi All,

I have addressed the previous feedback and updated the KIP accordingly:

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1315%3A+Split+Connect=
or+Listing+and+Expanded+Views+in+the+Connect+REST+API

