Subject: Re: [DISCUSS] KIP-1339: Make KafkaConfigBackingStore
 read_write_total_timeout configurable
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable
X-Mailer: WebService/1.1.25725 YMailNorrin
From: "Henry Haiying Cai via dev" <dev@kafka.apache.org>
