Subject: Clarification request: Kafka 3.7 to 4.2 rolling upgrade order for
 KRaft controllers and brokers
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="0000000000006520a20651d719f6"
From: Alireza Asgarian <ar.asgarian1389@gmail.com>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>

