it does not change the logic of auto.offset.reset=3Dearliest.
> 2) Mark auto.offset.reset.new.partitions as an internal configuration. =
auto.offset.reset.new.partitions=3Dearliest already addresses the issue, =
and we can discuss the use cases of other values in a separate KIP.
> 3) Both configs, auto.offset.reset.new.partitions and =
auto.offset.reset.latest.max.age.ms, will be applied to all for =
consistency.
