> >>>>>>>=20
> >>>>>>> However, realistically, this time skew should be negligible. Given
> >>> that
> >>>>> the max.age threshold will likely be configured in minutes or hours, a
> >>>>> typical NTP skew (in milliseconds) between brokers won't impact the
