> network connections but re-used the network connections from the=20
> underlying clients.
>=20
> To make KIP-714 work for Kafka Streams, we extended the client APIs to=20
> allow registering additional custom metrics (KIP-1076), to be send to=20
> the broker. However, these metrics are reported using the same=20
> `clientInstanceId` as the physical client. As a matter of fact, Kafka=20
