Hi Jun,
Thanks for your reply. It's tricky squaring a circle.

JR23: For GetTelemetrySubscriptions, I have changed it so that a client which=
 omits the ClientInstanceId from the request header is permitted to specify a=
 zero ClientInstanceId in the request body, following original KIP-714 preced=
ent. However, a client which specifies a ClientInstanceId in the request head=
er MUST specify the same ClientInstanceId in the request body. This ensures t=
hat the header and telemetry UUIDs are the same.

Thanks,
Andrew

