Subject: [DISCUSS] KIP-1347: Overriding voter set on storage formatting
To: dev <dev@kafka.apache.org>
Content-Type: multipart/alternative; boundary="000000000000ecabfa065217e6cd"
From: Paolo Patierno <paolo.patierno@gmail.com>
Reply-To: <dev@kafka.apache.org>

--000000000000ecabfa065217e6cd
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi all,
I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1347
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1347%3A+Overriding+voter+set+on+storage+formatting>
which
is about allowing the override of the voter set through the storage
formatting tool to recover a disaster scenario where the KRaft quorum can't
be formed anymore. This KIP aims to fix KAFKA-20427
<https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20427>.
Any feedback is very welcome.

Thanks,
Paolo.

-- 
