Hi Jun,
Thanks for your response.

JR23: You are absolutely correct. It seems to me that not sending a clientIns=
tanceId in the header and explicitly sending a zero UUID as the clientInstanc=
eId in the header can be treated as semantically equivalent. I've tweaked the=
 words slightly.

