Hi all,

This email starts the discussion thread for KIP-1351: Add --cancel-all to
kafka-reassign-partitions. The proposal adds optional cancel-all arguement
to kafka-reassign-partitions.sh so operators can stop all ongoing inter
broker partition reassignments using a single parameter via existing Admin
API.

I will appreciate your initial thoughts and feedback on the proposal.

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/t4CnGQ

Thanks,
Manan

