Manan Gupta created KAFKA-20614:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: KIP-1351: Add --cancel-all to kafka-reassign-partitions
                 Key: KAFKA-20614
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20614
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Task
            Reporter: Manan Gupta
            Assignee: Manan Gupta


Add an optional `cancel-all` arguement to `kafka-reassign-partitions.sh` so operators can stop all ongoing inter broker partition reassignments using a single parameter via existing Admin API

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1351%3A+Add+--cancel-all+to+kafka-reassign-partitions



