Hi again :) another thought about the high level target.

The proposed initial deadline (KIP freeze on June 8) shortens the 4 month
window (4.3 KIP freeze was Feb 25). Any reason for shortening this or could
we consider updating all dates to keep the ~4 month window between
deadlines and the final release? Release would target mid September
(instead of the proposed September 1st) With 4.3 released May 22nd, we
would still be within a release every 4 months with 4.4 targeting
mid-September. Thoughts?

Thanks!
Lianet

