Hi All,

We have identified a critical bug in the 4.3.0 release: KAFKA-20616 and
there is already a pending PR with a fix. With this in mind, I'm suggesting
we start the process for a 4.3.1 bug fix release.

If there is agreement, I will publish a release plan in the coming
days. I will volunteer to be RM for the release. Of course, I'm also
open to someone else taking the RM role.

Thanks,
Bill

--000000000000d13e760652be723d--

