Hi,

I was just looking into the proposed plan a little bit, and while this 
plan is good considering 4.4 release, it make we worry about 4.5 release 
-- if we aim for 4.5 with our 4-months cycle, it will fall onto the 
holidays again (and we learned from 4.2 and other "holiday" releases, 
that this does not "end well").

So I was wondering if we should shift this all back by one month, making 
it a 5-month cycle for 4.4 instead? I also started a general discussion 
on time-based releases, which will explain my overall reasoning.

Thoughts?


-Matthias

