Hi all,

I would like to start the vote on KIP-1331 which adds an opt-in
feature making the Kafka Streams topology graph available on the
broker via a plugin interface that handles broker-side storage. This
helps in understanding client behavior from the broker, in a similar
spirit as KIP-714.

KIP: https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1331%3A+Streams+Group+Topology+Description+Plugin

Discussion: https://lists.apache.org/thread/wmt4bo0x6mzbyq9ws5nnkqbc4z19t8nx

Best,
Lucas

