sanghyeok An created KAFKA-20641:
------------------------------------

             Summary: ConsumerGroup should clean up the state when a static member temporarily leaves
                 Key: KAFKA-20641
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-20641
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: sanghyeok An
            Assignee: sanghyeok An


When a static ConsumerGroup member temporarily leaves with LEAVE_GROUP_STATIC_MEMBER_EPOCH (-2),
  consumerGroupStaticMemberGroupLeave clears pending revocations but leaves UNREVOKED_PARTITIONS state unchanged.
  ConsumerGroup should match StreamsGroup semantics by treating unrevoked partitions as revoked and transitioning the member back to
  STABLE.




--
